ion or change is refused or accepted by the API\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-15.3\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows the returned error or cancellation response, current status, updated quantities, and stock availability count when returned\",\n     \"when\": \"the customer submits the action or refreshes the order\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A customer submits an order more than once or retries after a network interruption\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-15.4\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the captured request uses the same submission key for the retry and the screen shows one returned order record\",\n     \"when\": \"the web app sends the submission or retry\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An order submission is pending\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-15.5\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen sends only one order-submission request\",\n     \"when\": \"the customer repeats the submission\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When customers view, change, or cancel an order, the Meridian responsive web app shall show order status and allocated and outstanding quantities per line, expose change and cancellation controls only before Packed, and display API outcomes.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-15\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-3\",\n    \"I-10\",\n    \"I-11\",\n    \"Q-6\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An order line is allocated across lots\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-16.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows each returned lot, expiry date, allocated quantity, line split, and outstanding quantity separately\",\n     \"when\": \"a Dispatcher or customer opens allocation details\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A Dispatcher selects an alternative lot\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-16.2\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows a required reason field and the request includes the chosen lot and reason,