ipt history\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The Meridian responsive web app shall show temperature histories for boxes, cold rooms, and lots as charts and tables with returned readings, applicable bands, excursions, gaps, and reading flags or silence status.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-19\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"I-6\",\n    \"I-13\",\n    \"I-14\",\n    \"ASM-2\",\n    \"ASM-4\",\n    \"ASM-8\",\n    \"ASM-18\",\n    \"ASM-21\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API returns an excursion and its affected handling units\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-20.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows returned excursion start, end, readings, closure status, affected units, and used and remaining amounts by tier\",\n     \"when\": \"a user opens excursion or budget details\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API returns an open excursion, handling units, and hold statuses\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-20.2\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows affected handling units, tier budgets, and returned hold statuses\",\n     \"when\": \"a Quality Officer opens the excursion view\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API returns a remaining-budget warning, exhausted tier, or not-permitted-range alert\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-20.3\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows the returned alert category and affected stock or device\",\n     \"when\": \"a user opens alerts or quality status\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API returns an alert for silence, excursion, low or exhausted budget, not-permitted range, or corrected excursion\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-20.4\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows returned alert type, affected device or stock, recipient role and delivery metadata when returned, plus corrected excursion or budget status when present\",\n     \"when\": \"an intended user opens alert history\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The Meridian responsive web app shall show excursions, handling-unit budget use and remaining allowances, returned alerts, and returned hold and decision statuses for affected devices and stock.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-20\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"I-8\",\n    \"I-9\",\n    \"I-13\",\n    \"I-14\",\n    \"I-15\",\n    \"Q-2\",\n    \"Q-5\",\n    \"Q-8\",\n    \"ASM-4\",\n    \"ASM-10\",\n    \"ASM-18\",\n    \"ASM-22\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API returns a temperature-history gap for affected stock\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-21.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows the gap and API-returned review and stock status without estimating a temperature tier\",\n     \"when\": \"a Quality Officer opens the quality status\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When the API reports an unresolved temperature-history gap affecting stock, the Meridian responsive web app shall show the gap, review status, and API-returned stock status without estimating a temperature tier.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-21\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"I-6\",\n    \"I-8\",\n    \"I-13\",\n    \"I-14\",\n    \"Q-2\",\n    \"ASM-2\",\n    \"ASM-18\",\n    \"ASM-11\",\n    \"ASM-24\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The API reports an unresolved temperature-history gap affecting stock\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-22.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen shows On Hold until resolution and shows no automatic charge to an unobserved tier\",\n     \"when\": \"a user opens the affected stock detail\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When the API returns an unresolved temperature-history gap affecting stock, the Meridian responsive web app shall show the stock as On Hold until the gap is resolved and shall not charge an unobserved temperature tier automa